Type: project
Package: QuantitativeProteomicsEnv
Title: Package environment of the Quantitative-proteomics reports (R 4.2)
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Packages loaded by the Quantitative-proteomics launchers, parsers, library and reports.
    The lockfile renv.lock records the full dependency tree.
    Version caps, all due to R 4.2 and the bundled pandoc 2.2.1:
    rmarkdown < 2.32 (2.32 requires pandoc >= 2.8);
    GGally < 2.3.0 (2.3.0 and later require R >= 4.3);
    ggplot2 < 4.0.0 (GGally 2.2.1 is not compatible with ggplot2 4),
    and with it ggrepel < 0.9.6, patchwork < 1.3.0 and scales < 1.4.0,
    taken as built together in the CRAN repository of R 4.2 binaries.
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    base64enc,
    Biobase,
    data.table,
    dplyr,
    DT,
    fastcluster,
    GGally (< 2.3.0),
    ggdendro,
    ggplot2 (< 4.0.0),
    ggrepel (< 0.9.6),
    gridExtra,
    gtable,
    htmltools,
    kableExtra,
    knitr,
    limma,
    matrixStats,
    multtest,
    openxlsx,
    patchwork (< 1.3.0),
    RColorBrewer,
    readr,
    readxl,
    reshape2,
    rmarkdown (< 2.32),
    scales (< 1.4.0),
    scico,
    showtext,
    stringr,
    svglite,
    tibble,
    tidyr
